{"numberOfHits":1,"results":[{"id":"GO:1990748","isObsolete":false,"name":"cellular detoxification","definition":{"text":"Any process carried out at the cellular level that reduces or removes the toxicity of a toxic substance. These may include transport of the toxic substance away from sensitive areas and to compartments or complexes whose purpose is sequestration of the toxic substance."},"replaces":[{"id":"GO:0018908","type":"consider"},{"id":"GO:1901998","type":"consider"}],"children":[{"id":"GO:0140974","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0140961","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0140114","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0140977","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0110095","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0070458","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0110052","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0098869","relation":"is_a"}],"history":[{"timestamp":"2017-11-01","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"part of GO:0097237 (cellular response to toxic substance)"},{"timestamp":"2015-05-19","action":"Added","category":"TERM","text":"cellular detoxification"},{"timestamp":"2015-05-19","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0098754 (detoxification)"},{"timestamp":"2015-05-19","action":"Added","category":"DEFINITION","text":"Any process carried out at the cellular level that reduces or removes the toxicity of a toxic substance. These may include transport of the toxic substance away from sensitive areas and to compartments or complexes whose purpose is sequestration of the toxic substance."},{"timestamp":"2015-05-19","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0009987 (cellular process)"}],"xRelations":[{"id":"CL:0000000","term":"cell","namespace":"CL","url":"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ontology-lookup/?termId=CL:0000000","relation":"occurs_in"}],"aspect":"biological_process","usage":"Unrestricted"}],"pageInfo":null}